        },
        "body": "## Summary\n- keep `fix/session-refresh-stable` on the stable 2026-09-06 code path plus the observer/statistics changes from #158\n- fix the local `published_at does not exist` failure seen on the stabilized development database\n- do not enable the historical Flyway chain, because this branch intentionally keeps Flyway disabled for `flipbot_pr74`\n- instead apply only the small idempotent compatibility statements required by the observer change at backend startup\n- backfill `published_at` from `first_seen_at` for pre-existing observations and create the effective publication-time index\n- normalize any persisted `CAPTCHA_REQUIRED` runtime rows back to stable `ERROR` and restore the stable runtime-status check constraint\n\n## Why\nThe stable branch's `application.yml` intentionally has `spring.flyway.enabled=false`. #158 added V39, but on the existing local `flipbot_pr74` database that migration is therefore not executed. The backend query immediately fails because `market_listing_observation.published_at` is missing.\n\n## Scope\nNo normal bot login/session/worker/CAPTCHA implementation is changed. This is a narrow backend schema-compatibility initializer plus a unit test.",
